WEBVTT

00:02:25.116 --> 00:02:30.711
In my country, film had the potential
to go beyond cinema.

00:02:30.735 --> 00:02:32.502
It could change lives.

00:02:33.536 --> 00:02:37.248
The issues that I've always
wanted to raise --

00:02:37.272 --> 00:02:39.811
I've always wanted to hold up
a mirror to society --

00:02:39.835 --> 00:02:43.362
they've been driven
by my barometer of anger.

00:02:43.386 --> 00:02:48.622
And my barometer of anger
led me, in 2014, to honor killings.

00:02:49.397 --> 00:02:52.360
Honor killings take place
in many parts of the world,

00:02:52.384 --> 00:02:57.412
where men punish women
who transgress rules made by them:

00:02:57.436 --> 00:03:00.406
women who choose
to marry on their own free will;